00:00:07.257 --> 00:00:08.457
- They chose that job!

00:00:08.457 --> 00:00:10.579
- [Crowd] (cheers)
- They chose that job!

00:00:10.579 --> 00:00:11.528
- No justice!

00:00:11.528 --> 00:00:12.530
- [Crowd] No peace!

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:13.538
- No racist!

00:00:13.538 --> 00:00:14.591
- [Crowd] Police!

00:00:14.591 --> 00:00:15.670
- Say his name!

00:00:15.670 --> 00:00:16.557
- [Crowd] George Floyd!

00:00:16.557 --> 00:00:17.515
- [Woman with Cap] Say his name!

00:00:17.515 --> 00:00:18.429
- [Crowd] George Floyd!

00:00:18.429 --> 00:00:19.262
- [Woman with Cap] Say his name!

00:00:19.262 --> 00:00:21.179
- [Crowd] George Floyd!

00:00:26.028 --> 00:00:28.560
