waters that are talking--

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:38.760
- No, no, no, no, no, no.

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:39.593
- [Woman with Cap] You're
getting into waters--

00:00:39.593 --> 00:00:40.520
I'm not taking sides!

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:43.157
- We've gotta get home to,
and it's about us right now!

00:00:43.157 --> 00:00:45.140
