00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:48.709
You got a conscience!

00:00:48.709 --> 00:00:50.209
This what makes you better,

00:00:50.209 --> 00:00:52.640
because you consciously think
about the next man's family

00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:54.900
