00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:56.880
Rape you, spit on you, but you know what?

00:00:56.880 --> 00:00:59.303
You don't let the circumstance change you.

00:00:59.303 --> 00:01:00.787
- [Woman with Cap] What if they kill you?

00:01:00.787 --> 00:01:02.133
- You know what?

00:01:02.133 --> 00:01:03.230
You're better than that.

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:04.115
- [Woman with Cap] But you're dead!

00:01:04.115 --> 00:01:05.289
- [Crowd] Yeah, you're dead!

00:01:05.289 --> 00:01:07.269
- [Woman with Cap] You
can't go home, you're dead!

00:01:07.269 --> 00:01:08.600
But you're saying you gotta deal with that

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:10.981
as if I gotta deal with
my Black life being lost,

00:01:10.981 --> 00:01:12.990
because they can go home safe every night,

00:01:12.990 --> 00:01:14.428
but I gotta worry about getting home--

00:01:14.428 --> 00:01:15.392
- They chose that job!

00:01:15.392 --> 00:01:17.740
- [Crowd] (cheers)
- They chose that job!

00:01:17.740 --> 00:01:19.710
- I didn't choose my skin color!

00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:21.667
I didn't choose my skin color,
but they chose that job.

00:01:21.667 --> 00:01:23.350
- No no no, this is to make you better

00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:24.849
and I'ma tell you why.

00:01:24.849 --> 00:01:27.167
Because we're not afraid of death.

00:01:27.167 --> 00:01:28.848
- I am afraid of death!

00:01:28.848 --> 00:01:29.760
I don't wanna die!

00:01:29.760 --> 00:01:31.480
Black cops, White cops, Mexican cops,

00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:33.530
