00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:48.290
This is an issue about voting.

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:50.840
If Biden comes in tomorrow,
it's gonna be the same issue

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:52.120
because this is based on a system

00:01:52.120 --> 00:01:53.934
of institutionalized racism.

00:01:53.934 --> 00:01:56.851
- [Crowd] (cheers)

00:01:57.716 --> 00:02:00.040
- This is the United States
of Holding the Traditions

00:02:00.040 --> 00:02:02.776
