00:02:02.776 --> 00:02:06.060
So when I heard you guys telling
the cops to walk with us,

00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:08.220
I was looking at all of y'all different.

00:02:08.220 --> 00:02:09.480
Because they're doing the same thing.

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:10.840
They can walk with us today,

00:02:10.840 --> 00:02:12.010
but tomorrow they're still gonna

00:02:12.010 --> 00:02:13.410
kill us in the street like animals.

00:02:13.410 --> 00:02:16.185
- [Crowd] (cheers)

00:02:16.185 --> 00:02:18.485
- This is not gonna
change with a simple vote!

00:02:19.465 --> 00:02:22.330
The change comes from
revolutionary tactics.

00:02:22.330 --> 00:02:24.969
The police system was
based off of slavery.

00:02:24.969 --> 00:02:27.448
It started as slave markets.

00:02:27.448 --> 00:02:29.100
The police system started as people

00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:31.710
who went out to grab slaves.

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:33.490
Have you guys read the
Thirteenth Amendment?

00:02:33.490 --> 00:02:34.890
Slavery was never abolished.

00:02:34.890 --> 00:02:36.690
Look at the mass incarceration system!

00:02:36.690 --> 00:02:39.336
There's multiple Black
and brown bodies there.

00:02:39.336 --> 00:02:41.048
This system was built against us!

00:02:41.048 --> 00:02:42.900
It was built against people like me.

00:02:42.900 --> 00:02:44.369
So I'm tired, as a young Black woman,

00:02:44.369 --> 00:02:46.390
knowing that tomorrow
if I get shot down dead,

00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:47.600
it's gonna be the same thing.

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:48.433
The same hashtag.

00:02:48.433 --> 00:02:50.940
But many of you guys treat
it like it's a trend.

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:52.460
Many of you guys treat
it like it's a hashtag.

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:54.249
This is not a hashtag, this is my life.

00:02:54.249 --> 00:02:57.166
- [Crowd] (cheers)

00:03:00.504 --> 00:03:03.930
- So frankly, I'm sick and
tired of the Instagram chains.

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:05.010
Just the "Black Lives Matter".

00:03:05.010 --> 00:03:05.843
