00:03:43.250 --> 00:03:46.149
Hell, it even helped the
war criminal, fucking Obama!

00:03:46.149 --> 00:03:49.066
- [Crowd] (cheers)

00:03:50.439 --> 00:03:51.747
- So we sit here and we protest,

00:03:51.747 --> 00:03:53.310
