00:03:53.310 --> 00:03:54.506
Donate to crowdfunds.

00:03:54.506 --> 00:03:55.930
Donate to bails.

00:03:55.930 --> 00:03:57.920
Get people out of prisons.

00:03:57.920 --> 00:03:58.990
But also if you're White,

00:03:58.990 --> 00:04:01.180
