00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:18.060
Where are those friends, huh?

00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:19.280
Are they standing up?

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:22.660
They get the perms, they
rock the box braids,

00:04:22.660 --> 00:04:24.590
