but they're not out here

00:04:24.590 --> 00:04:25.849
representing Black people?

00:04:25.849 --> 00:04:28.766
- [Crowd] (cheers)

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:30.720
- We're here to be heard.

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:33.490
So if it gets violent,
it started with them.

00:04:33.490 --> 00:04:35.150
So I don't want you telling
me to walk with them.

00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:36.110
I'm not walking with the cop

00:04:36.110 --> 00:04:37.810
that could kill me tomorrow, okay?

00:04:37.810 --> 00:04:41.198
- [Crowd] (cheers)

00:04:41.198 --> 00:04:42.450
- And if you want to do that, go ahead,

00:04:42.450 --> 00:04:43.868
but just know you're not of the cause,

00:04:43.868 --> 00:04:44.701
you're part of the issue.

00:04:44.701 --> 00:04:45.800
You're part of the problem.

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:48.810
- I have been shot at,
I have been aimed at,

00:04:48.810 --> 00:04:51.930
I have been gassed, I watched
a young woman be dragged

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:55.080
by her fucking hair for resisting arrest

00:04:55.080 --> 00:04:58.650
