00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:07.400
Say hi!

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:08.247
- [Woman] That's right.

00:05:08.247 --> 00:05:10.058
- Give them a word of encouragement.

00:05:10.058 --> 00:05:12.175
Let them know to stay strong.
- [Crowd] (cheers)

00:05:12.175 --> 00:05:13.360
- Let them know that they're not alone.

00:05:13.360 --> 00:05:14.750
Let them know that you love them,

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:16.520
let them know that they're safe,

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:19.330
